#: scenario8:scenario8_967B5939_34D0_4050_A3AD_C6760B9AAA79
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7e6e07bf449a0aead74a478d3d7e25df1a927bc4096207e1ea5c51a33b71da89
